--   4. SP_LOAD_CLOUD_SVC_MART — MERGE trailing 3 days from the extract.
--   5. SP_PURGE_FACTS re-derived (V054) to trim the new mart.
--
--   Additive columns + one new table/proc + two proc swaps. Apply AFTER V054.
